3","sourceIndex":2,"part":3,"parts":3,"wordRange":[24,34],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"silks from India, copper coffee pots, and beautiful handmade silverware.","start":33.57,"end":39.16,"score":0.967,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-004","sourceId":"b3-028-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It was difficult not to be tempted.","start":40.24,"end":42.38,"score":0.997,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-005","sourceId":"b3-028-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Many of the tourists on board had begun bargaining with the tradesmen, but I decided not to buy anything until I had disembarked.","start":43.16,"end":51.85,"score":0.95,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-006","sourceId":"b3-028-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I had no sooner got off the ship than I was assailed by a man who wanted to sell me a diamond ring.","start":53.49,"end":59.82,"score":0.963,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-007-p01","sourceId":"b3-028-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I had no intention of buying one,","start":60.86,"end":62.72,"score":0.978,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-007-p02","sourceId":"b3-028-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[7,24],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"but I could not conceal the fact that I was impressed by the size of the diamonds.","start":63.14,"end":67.89,"score":0.948,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-008","sourceId":"b3-028-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,8],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Some of them were as big as marbles.","start":68.8,"end":71.13,"score":0.964,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-009","sourceId":"b3-028-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The man went to great lengths to prove that the diamonds were real.","start":72.36,"end":76.11,"score":0.929,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-010","sourceId":"b3-028-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"As we were walking past a shop, he held a diamond firmly against the window and made a deep impression in the glass.","start":77.14,"end":83.78,"score":0.911,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["low-word-confidence"]},{"id":"b3-028-011","sourceId":"b3-028-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It took me over half an hour to get rid of him.","start":84.88,"end":87.46,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-012","sourceId":"b3-028-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,12],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The next man to approach me was selling expensive pens and watches.","start":89.08,"end":93.04,"score":0.984,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-013","sourceId":"b3-028-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,7],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I examined one of the pens closely.","start":93.96,"end":96.02,"score":0.988,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-014","sourceId":"b3-028-014","sourceIndex":13,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,4],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"It certainly looked genuine.","start":96.72,"end":98.34,"score":0.805,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-015","sourceId":"b3-028-015","sourceIndex":14,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"At the base of the gold cap, the words 'made in the U.S.A.' had been neatly inscribed.","start":99.18,"end":105.34,"score":0.975,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-016","sourceId":"b3-028-016","sourceIndex":15,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,22],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The man said that the pen was worth ￡50, but as a special favour, he would let me have it for ￡30.","start":106.32,"end":113.403,"score":0.954,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-017","sourceId":"b3-028-017","sourceIndex":16,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"I shook my head and held up five fingers indicating that I was willing to pay ￡5.","start":115.03,"end":120.94,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-018","sourceId":"b3-028-018","sourceIndex":17,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,21],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Gesticulating wildly, the man acted as if he found my offer outrageous, but he eventually reduced the price to 10 pounds.","start":122.85,"end":131.4,"score":0.974,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-019","sourceId":"b3-028-019","sourceIndex":18,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,23],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"Shrugging my shoulders I began to walk away when, a moment later, he ran after me and thrust the pen into my hands.","start":132.57,"end":140.62,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-020","sourceId":"b3-028-020","sourceIndex":19,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,17],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"Though he kept throwing up his arms in despair, he readily accepted the ￡5 I gave him.","start":141.48,"end":147.04,"score":0.981,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-021","sourceId":"b3-028-021","sourceIndex":20,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"I felt especially pleased with my wonderful bargain--until I got back to the ship.","start":147.93,"end":153.73,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-022-p01","sourceId":"b3-028-022","sourceIndex":21,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"No matter how hard I tried,","start":154.2,"end":156.29,"score":0.991,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b3-028-022-p02","sourceId":"b3-028-022","sourceIndex":21,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[6,27],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"it was impossible to fill this beautiful pen with ink and to this day it has never written a single word!","start":156.5,"end":163.61,"score":0.994,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]}]}
